    <string name="help_sheet_title">Windows Proxy Setup</string>
    <string name="help_step_1_title">1. Connect to Wi-Fi Direct</string>
    <string name="help_step_1_body">On your Windows laptop, open Wi-Fi networks and join the DIRECT-… SSID using the passphrase shown in Orion.</string>
    <string name="help_step_2_title">2. Configure Manual Proxy</string>
    <string name="help_step_2_body">Open Settings → Network &amp; internet → Proxy → Manual proxy setup → Set up, then turn Use a proxy server On.</string>
    <string name="help_step_3_title">3. Enter IP &amp; Port</string>
    <string name="help_step_3_body">Set Proxy IP address to 192.168.49.1 and Port to 8282, then click Save. Both HTTP and HTTPS (CONNECT) traffic will tunnel over mobile data.</string>
    <string name="help_qs_section_title">Quick Settings Switch</string>
    <string name="help_qs_section_body">Toggle Orion directly from Android Quick Settings without opening the app.</string>
